  "summary": "Malicious code in @onereach/si-dropdown-advanced (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (node setup.mjs) downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun and executes a 727KB obfuscated payload (math_init.js) at install time. The payload is obfuscated with a custom base64-style decoder and large string-array constants, hiding its behaviour. A UI dropdown component has no legitimate need to download a runtime and run an obfuscated payload during npm install; this is a trojanized package executing attacker-controlled code on the installer's machine.",
